OL,3,GNEWSAOxford stadium opponents to
OL,4,Acontinue legal fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners say they will appeal a
OL,7,Fjudge's decision to refuse permission
OL,8,Ffor a judicial review of Oxford
OL,9,FUnited's new 16,000-seater stadium
OL,10,Fplanning approval.
OL,12,FThe club's plans to build on land known
OL,13,Fas the Triangle, near Kidlington, were
OL,14,Ffirst approved by Cherwell District
OL,15,FCouncil and then by the government last
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
