OL,3,GNEWSAOxford stadium opponents to
OL,4,Acontinue legal fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FFriends of Stratfield Brake (FoSB)
OL,7,Ffirst lodged their legal complaint
OL,8,Fciting potential impact on local
OL,9,Fwildlife, as well as aspects of the
OL,10,Fplanned road closures, in April after
OL,11,Flaunching a fundraiser to cover the
OL,12,Flegal costs.
OL,14,FOxford United previously suggested its
OL,15,Ffuture could be in jeopardy if the new
OL,16,Fground was not built.
